  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1733876730_9257854_d157432067e25ef8fb8e82b655313520.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">• Brand introduction:&nbsp;</p><p><strong>DotCard</strong>, created by a passionate game enthusiast from Northern Sweden, is a global game for family and friends. With its engaging gameplay, this game will surely bring joy and connection to people from all over the world.&nbsp;Perfect for all ages and occasions,&nbsp;<strong>DotCard</strong> is sure to provide endless fun and memories.</p><p><strong>DotCard</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>is a card game played over ten or twenty rounds. Each round is finished when any player is out of cards. The remaining players add the points they have left on the cards left in their hand. The winner is the one who completes all rounds with the lowest score.</p><p>The cards in<span>&nbsp;</span><strong>DotCard</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>look like dominoes. Each round starts with a different card value, e.g., in round one every player has to start with a card that has nine dots, in round two cards with eight dots, and so on.</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>• Product description:</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">A Timeless Exciting Family Card Game for Young and Old. A strategic family game, loved from 9 to 99 years. A card game suitable for all playing styled, everything from family games between adults and children, to the advanced game enthusiast. DotCard challenges your creativity and strategic thinking.</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Includes: Travel Case,&nbsp;66 Cards,&nbsp;Rules (English, French, Spanish, German, Dutch, Swedish, Norwegian, Danish, and Finnish), Scorecards</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Card Size: 3.5\" x 2.5\"</p></div></div>",
